{"id":"903bc1b61d6713be","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-lem-filter-extension.md","title":"Ultrafilter Extension","display":"lem-filter-extension — Ultrafilter Extension","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-filter-extension","aliases":["58-lem-filter-extension"],"display":"lem-filter-extension — Ultrafilter Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-lem-zorn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-filter-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-filter-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-filter-extension — Ultrafilter Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"576d33e6f68f255a\" href=\"?note=576d33e6f68f255a\" title=\"58-lem-zorn\">58-lem-zorn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,F\\in V\">\\(X,F\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(X\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\)</span> are the exact set-filter predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}_S\\)</span> is the choice principle used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"576d33e6f68f255a\" href=\"?note=576d33e6f68f255a\" title=\"58-lem-zorn\">58-lem-zorn</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land F\\subseteq U\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land F\\subseteq U\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every filter can be extended to an ultrafilter.</li>\n<li>In ZFC this follows from Zorn's lemma; over ZF the ultrafilter lemma is strictly weaker than full choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-lem-zorn","status":"resolved","id":"576d33e6f68f255a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-lem-zorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-lem-zorn","status":"resolved","id":"576d33e6f68f255a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}_S$ is the choice principle used by [[58-lem-zorn]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land F\\subseteq U\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":980,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3894","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-lem-filter-extension.md|58-lem-filter-extension]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5a7d94a7a7f8209a","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","576d33e6f68f255a"]}